    "description_md": "Picophytoplankton (Prochlorococcus, Synechococcus, picoeukaryotes) and heterotrophic bacteria abundances analyzed by flow cytometry (FCM) from CCE-CalCOFI Augmented cruises in the California Current System, 2004-2023 (ongoing). Seawater collected from Niskin bottles at 3-8 depths per station; cells fixed shipboard with paraformaldehyde, stained with a DNA-specific dye, and enumerated on an Altra flow cytometer with dual argon-ion lasers.\n",
